        <item>
            <title>v0.2.0</title>
            <link>https://github.com/JaimeOrtegaxyz/Islands/releases/tag/v0.2.0</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.2.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <pubDate>FILL_AT_RELEASE</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Stacks are now islands: a slim tab bar above them shows each window's icon and title. Click a tab to switch, drag to reorder. Windows never move when you switch, so no more flicker.</li>
                    <li>Prefer less on screen? Settings → Island marker → Slim shows a short row of dashes instead (replaces Peek size).</li>
                    <li>Arrows go where you point: a window moved by hand moves the way you press.</li>
                    <li>Islands stay put: moving one window out no longer yanks the others back.</li>
                    <li>Windows that refuse to shrink past a minimum size (Finder with its sidebar, Chrome) now stay fully on screen.</li>
                    <li>Apps that round their own size (terminals, Spotify) no longer get stuck re-snapping to the same spot.</li>
                    <li>Less work per keypress, and the auto-updater has its latest security fixes.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/JaimeOrtegaxyz/Islands/releases/download/v0.2.0/Islands-0.2.0.dmg"
                type="application/x-apple-diskimage"
                sparkle:edSignature="FILL_FROM_dist/Islands-0.2.0.sig.txt"
                length="FILL_FROM_dist/Islands-0.2.0.sig.txt" />
        </item>
