            <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:55:04 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Reliable snapping for Spotify and Electron/Chromium apps that used to drift around or shrink into a thin strip.</li>
                    <li>Minimized windows now stay in the Dock when you snap others in the same stack.</li>
                    <li>Hardened the window-management internals against rare hangs and crashes.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
